  "holistic_F_N": 2,
  "holistic_F_H": -2,
  "section_notes": "S1 is strong: all incidents reported within 24 hours and customer notice within 72 hours. S2 is weakened by a 5-year 7% phase-in and an open-ended corrective-action pathway that lets existing models above the 5% limit continue selling indefinitely. S3 and S4 meet acceptable ranges (6-year retrofit, 36-month suppression). S5 has a mandatory 8/100k recall trigger but no transition and only 'promptly' notice."
